    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d730">

                <pb facs="0852" n="756" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg756"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Leishman to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Berne,
                                Switzerland</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-06-02"><hi rendition="#italic">June 2,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 153.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my dispatch, No. 139, of March
                    23, 1899, I now have the honor to transmit to you herewith copy together with
                    translation <pb facs="0853" n="757" xml:id="pg757"/> of a note from the Swiss
                    Government, dated May 31, informing me of its decision to accept the
                    denunciation of the Articles VIII to XII of the treaty of November 25, 1850,
                    between the United States and Switzerland.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John G. A.
                    Leishman.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d730-a1.xml" xpointer="d730-a1"/>
            </div>
